      "text": "q-variational Hörmander functional calculus and Schrödinger and wave maximal estimates — 12 sections: Front matter; Introduction; R-boundedness\n\n**q-variational Hörmander functional calculus and Schrödinger and wave maximal estimates**\n\n*The documents may come from teaching and research*\n\n43 pp, 12 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; R-boundedness; Preliminaries; UMD lattices; Abstract Hörmander functional calculus; q-variational inequalities; q-variation for spherical and euclidean ball m; Schrödinger and wave maximal estimates; Pointwise continuity of time paths for abstrac; Examples and concluding remarks; Acknowledgments",
